flowchart LR
  A["<b>Idea</b><br/>what to build<br/>and why"]
  B["<b>Draft spec</b><br/>in Confluence,<br/>with up-to-date<br/>docs (Context7)"]
  C["<b>Review spec</b><br/> decisions, make corrections, elaborate on decisions"]
  D["<b>Plan and build</b><br/>tickets in Jira,<br/>code and tests<br/>together"]
